  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The site uses four fonts. Every Font menu in the editor lists them by name: Broadacre, Broadacre Medium, Arsenica Variable, Arsenica Text. Each name always means that font. To swap the font on anything, pick a different name in its Font menu."
